# Answer key and walkthroughs. `COPY . .` would otherwise place these at
# /app inside the image, where any of the live file-read findings
# (path-traversal-invoice, file-inclusion-rce, os-command-injection,
# python-pickle-rce, ...) turns one solve into a walkthrough for the other 94.
# findings.yaml goes too: the image ships findings.runtime.yaml instead, which
# tools/strip_catalog.py generates with the answer-key fields removed.
